  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Security Center now includes these new features, available in public preview:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/security-center/security-center-container-recommendations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Security state of containers</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/security-center/security-center-network-recommendations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Network visibility map</a></li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/security-center/security-center-info-protection-policy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Information protection for Azure SQL Database</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Threat detection for Azure&nbsp;Blob storage and Azure Database for PostgreSQL</li>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/security-center/security-center-secure-score\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Secure score</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Limited public preview features:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=v4j5cvGGr0GRqy180BHbRykv0w7KoL5Jj4AzbOLp7XxUNDlHQ0Q5QzBMRDVDSU4wU0cxQVJMMVdWRi4u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adaptive network controls&nbsp;</a>(NSG) and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://forms.office.com/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=v4j5cvGGr0GRqy180BHbR9URRPpixVFElWlu1W-9OqdUNE4xWUQ1WkNSTjE3SkFVOTEwNldERURaUC4u\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Regulatory compliance requirements monitoring</a>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Security Center now includes these new features, available in public preview:\n\nSecurity state of containers\n\nNetwork visibility map\n\nInformation protection for Azure SQL Database\n\nThreat detection for Azure Blob storage and Azure Database for PostgreSQL\n\nSecure score\n\nLimited public preview features:\n\nAdaptive network controls (NSG) and Regulatory compliance requirements monitoring ."
  },
